    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Twenty years is a long time.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Yan has moved an entire city onto a nomadic platform. Other nomadic cities like it are popping up across the land.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The Sky Mirror Pavilion has been expanded several times in order to accommodate the books collected from far and wide, transforming it beyond recognition.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Twenty years is a short time.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Our family rarely saw one another.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Shuo and Ling remain on the border. Jun is planning to move to Danyan, after compiling the Laws of Yan. Shu is living in Dahuang. Ji and Yi travel far and wide, each for their own reasons, while Nian is as carefree as ever.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Rumor has it that F\u0101ng has left Yanese territory. Dusk refuses to come out of her scroll. Meanwhile, business at Yu's restaurant is booming, as it has been for decades.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "As for Wang...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "He shut himself in an ancient temple and has remained there for twenty years to improve his 'weiqi skills'.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When will he be willing to see me again?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 320,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "m",
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jie? The Imperial Historical Cabinet wants an update on the review of Jiangqi's local chronicles\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oops, you caught me slacking off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright. I've already taken a look at it and circled all the issues. Do you want to take another look?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$book_close"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Hm, when did it...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really should get some rest, it's getting to you. I've been watching you work longer hours and sleep less year after year...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the local annals, the construction chronicles, veritable records of the previous True Lung, ancient history textbooks for the Academy... <i>I</i> feel overworked, and all I do is organize the books for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard that the Ministry of Works's requests have been dropping, and Shu's workload at Dahuang is no longer as heavy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the burden on your shoulders doesn't ever seem to get lighter...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I got distracted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, I guess I'm tired. I should set this work aside for now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. How about we go out for a walk in town?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not today, I don't think I'm in the mood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you see anything interesting in town, bring some back for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
