    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Candleholder Chun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stern Yanese Mandarin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that's me. What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have an urgent letter for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stern Yanese Mandarin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "For me? From who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone had sent a letter to the Sui Regulator. The Supervisor was shocked by its contents and forwarded it to His Majesty, as well as every Candleholder who deals with the proxies directly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stern Yanese Mandarin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's in this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not know. The Supervisor's instructions to you are to be ready, but refrain from acting without permission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stern Yanese Mandarin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: Birth.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 220,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nYear \u25a0\u25a0: Fought Shuo, resulting in great property damage to the people.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 270,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: Framed a mandarin for a crime he did not commit, in order to cover up for one of his own kind.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 220,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nYear \u25a0\u25a0: Met with other proxies in secret without the Sui Regulator's knowledge. The Sui Regulator suffered a fire several months later, the cause of which is unknown.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 270,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nYear \u25a0\u25a0: Claimed to kill the bestial Ju, but had in fact allowed it to leave the domain of Yan.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 270,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Framing an official, meeting in secret, arson, sheltering a Feranmut...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wang?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Wang really do this? But there's no record in the Sui Regulator's archives!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You're still here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "I have another message for you, Candleholder Chun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stern Yanese Mandarin?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eliminate the great evil, before dealing with the culprit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stern Yanese Mandarin?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast"
    },
    {
        "text": "The frightened Candleholder hurries back to the Sky Mirror Pavilion and passes by some officials leaving the building."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "70_g4_tjdiscussionroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear about Jie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Well-Connected Minister?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. She's been throwing her weight around, doing whatever she wants with the history books, and there is no one in the Sky Mirror Pavilion or the Imperial Historical Cabinet who can stop her. It's becoming a real problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Benevolent Censor?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Candleholder has been negligent in her duties. She should be held responsible if the history of Yan falls into chaos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Well-Connected Minister?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The Candleholder turns around and sees the two figures leaving quickly."
    },
    {
        "text": "Still unsettled, she picks up a scroll left on the shelf by the Sui Regulator."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: Birth\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Candleholder knows that something is not right, but she could not stop her eyes from following the words."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: Domination of the Sky Mirror Pavilion and the Imperial Historical Cabinet. Her intentions are pure, but no one is able to check her power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: The True Lung attempts to eliminate Sui to neutralize the Jie threat. The Tomb of Sui was empty when it was open.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: Imperial Historical Cabinet abolished. Takes control of the written language of Yan. No one may oppose her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Year \u25a0\u25a0: Reviews the livelihood of every household in the land. Anyone who has committed fraudulent acts has their name erased and is exiled to the borders. Thousands die\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not real, none of this is true! She's not like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Several visitors gaze curiously at the woman in Candleholder garb. Chun wipes the cold sweat off her brow, and sees an ordinary book of poems in her hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must be possessed. Yes, that's it. She's not like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure she will never become like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The frightened Candleholder can no longer tell who is talking to her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She will change as her power continues to grow. She will become It.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1,
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She does not want to become It.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is seeking your help. She does not want to become that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yan is seeking your help. This ending is unacceptable to Yan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "She cannot help but become more powerful, more terrible, than the Sui beast itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must help her. Only you can help her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... can't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll make the choice that is best for everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.6,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Best for everyone...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, who was talking to me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "She sees no one, only the echo of the words ringing in her ears."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
