    {
        "text": "Your Imperial Majesty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "58_g5_dragonpalace",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The young official walks into the magnificent hall. It is her first time here."
    },
    {
        "text": "The supreme sovereign is not sitting on the throne, but standing by the window and gazing at the drizzle outside."
    },
    {
        "text": "You are aware that the Grand Preceptor passed away yesterday.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was your teacher and mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "He recommended you before he died. He said you were his proudest student, that you can be trusted with heavy responsibility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were certain things that I did not have time to ask him, and so I have to ask you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am listening, Your Majesty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Twenty years ago, the Grand Preceptor opposed my decision to build the nomadic cities. He said it was an oppressive policy, and that my first priority should be to conserve and give the people relief.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Twenty years have passed since. Some say that Yan's borders are secure and its coffers rich, a golden age not seen in a thousand years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some say that Great Yan is exhausted, and its people discontent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think I was wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am but one person, and it is not my place to judge Your Imperial Majesty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I were a wealthy merchant enjoying a luxurious life in a nomadic city, and I said that you were a great and wise leader, would you consider such compliment honest counsel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I were a common peasant whose family died in the construction projects, and I called you a foolish tyrant with no merit whatsoever, would such criticism be fair and just?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ask Your Majesty in turn...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it the opinion of future generations that you are concerned about, or is it something else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have a way with words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. I will not ask you to judge. Instead, give me a word of advice in your teacher's place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "He once said something that has stayed with me my entire life...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "'In worldly turmoil we tread, in our own conscience we trust'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even an ordinary peasant has a hard time finding a fair and impartial judgment in the complex affairs of a lifetime, let alone Your Majesty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no measure by which your deeds can be judged. In your heart, however, I am sure that your conscience holds the true measure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "In our own conscience we trust...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if my conscience tells me that I have never been wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you would not have summoned me today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would simply remind you that the people of Yan can see you, even if they do not know you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it will take more effort if you wish, from within the Forbidden City, to see the people clearly, and thus see the good and ill of your own actions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will remember that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will remember it for the twenty years to come... if I have them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Grand Preceptor's assessment of his own student is well justified... report to the Ministry of Rites tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Imperial Majesty honors me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erudite Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
