    },
    {
        "text": "The tired True Lung walks back to the throne. There is a letter of indictment on his desk."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was sent by the Sui Regulator."
    },
    {
        "text": "In worldly turmoil we tread, in our own conscience we trust...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "A life measured in years, yet the stress... feels ancient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let future generations judge my deeds as they will... but the bane of Yan must not be left to the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1634_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Your Majesty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Imperial Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ready the troops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "We shall open the Tomb of Sui.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
