    {
        "text": "Another long, tiring day."
    },
    {
        "text": "The proxy returns to the familiar temple, and casts his gaze at the weiqi board in a corner as is his habit. One glance is all it takes to notice that something is not right."
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone has been here."
    },
    {
        "text": "The weiqi board is empty, except for a single object in the middle, though it is dark in the room and he cannot see what it is."
    },
    {
        "text": "As he approaches, he sees that placed at the center is a ripe, white ginkgo seed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
