        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "That ginkgo sapling was planted in the spring of this year.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ministry of Works swore an oath in this hall several days ago that the rebuilding of Baizao into a nomadic city will be complete before the tree bears fruit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Twenty years. That is the time you have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Immortality has made you arrogant. Perhaps you have forgotten that mortals do not have many 'twenty years'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yan cannot wait, and neither can I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "True Lung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
