    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "This game should have been doomed."
    },
    {
        "text": "How can the part defeat the whole? How can one kill 'oneself' and survive?"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he saw the only way out, for all of them."
    },
    {
        "text": "He will supplant It."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$flashback",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
