    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps there will come a day when our strength exceeds Its. Then, we can truly break free of Its influence, and live as 'ourselves'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as we don't forget who we are, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
